      "content": "i get that, but you're kind of dismissing the whole point of the enforcement argument. like, even if you think it won't lead to more crossings, there's still the issue of sovereignty and the immediate cost of managing the border. can you just be straight with me—is there really a legitimate economic case for prioritizing enforcement, or is that just a political talking point that doesn't actually hold up to scrutiny?",
